<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445565891"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:37.489"><div begin="11.939" end="19.737" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="11.939" end="15.160" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.939" end="12.376">Yo</span> <span begin="12.990" end="13.275">我是</span><span begin="13.275" end="13.726">艾热</span> <span begin="14.209" end="14.590">所以</span><span begin="14.590" end="15.160">热爱</span></p><p begin="15.836" end="18.359" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.836" end="16.037">我</span><span begin="16.037" end="16.588">为爱而</span><span begin="16.588" end="16.892">生</span> <span begin="17.119" end="17.318">我</span><span begin="17.318" end="17.941">为爱而</span><span begin="17.941" end="18.359">活</span></p><p begin="19.083" end="19.737" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.083" end="19.238">You</span> <span begin="19.238" end="19.737">ready?</span></p></div><div begin="20.882" end="42.154" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.882" end="24.061" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.882" end="21.379">我路过</span><span begin="21.542" end="21.920">了落寞</span> <span begin="22.143" end="22.563">被数落</span> <span begin="22.809" end="23.272">孤独过</span> <span begin="23.498" end="24.061">吐露过</span></p><p begin="24.282" end="26.132" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.282" end="24.621">不服地</span><span begin="24.621" end="25.230">抱紧自我</span> <span begin="25.230" end="25.614">印象</span><span begin="25.614" end="26.132">深刻</span></p><p begin="26.200" end="28.826" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.200" end="26.720">疏忽过</span> <span begin="26.840" end="27.215">当幸福</span><span begin="27.215" end="27.590">靠近</span> <span begin="27.590" end="28.240">却没把握</span><span begin="28.240" end="28.826">住我</span></p><p begin="28.888" end="31.437" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.888" end="29.597">诉说得更多</span> <span begin="29.597" end="30.581">反而 更多困惑</span> <span begin="30.581" end="30.927">更想</span><span begin="30.927" end="31.437">沉默</span></p><p begin="31.509" end="34.128" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.509" end="32.026">你用爱</span> <span begin="32.152" end="32.677">融化掉</span><span begin="32.784" end="33.344">我浮躁</span><span begin="33.435" end="34.128">的心跳</span></p><p begin="34.189" end="36.799" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.189" end="34.658">因为有</span><span begin="34.800" end="35.197">善良的</span><span begin="35.197" end="35.594">心灵</span> <span begin="35.594" end="36.276">伴着美丽</span><span begin="36.276" end="36.799">样貌</span></p><p begin="36.800" end="39.400" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.800" end="37.278">因为你</span><span begin="37.278" end="37.876">独一无二</span> <span begin="37.876" end="38.556">做你自己</span><span begin="38.556" end="38.886">从不</span><span begin="38.886" end="39.400">彷照</span></p><p begin="39.505" end="42.154" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.505" end="39.940">激起我</span><span begin="39.940" end="40.566">内心浪潮</span> <span begin="40.566" end="40.953">就算在</span><span begin="40.953" end="41.292">一开始</span><span begin="41.292" end="41.661">我真的没</span><span begin="41.661" end="42.154">想到</span></p></div><div begin="42.031" end="1:00.955" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v2"><p begin="42.031" end="44.885" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="42.031" end="42.343">为了</span><span begin="42.343" end="42.623">你</span> <span begin="42.623" end="43.250">我能</span><span begin="43.250" end="43.628">疯</span><span begin="43.818" end="44.344">狂</span><span begin="44.344" end="44.885">到</span></p><p begin="45.939" end="50.266" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="45.939" end="46.627">山崩</span><span begin="46.627" end="47.259">海啸</span> <span begin="47.259" end="47.629">没有</span><span begin="47.629" end="47.950">你</span> <span begin="47.950" end="48.627">根本</span><span begin="48.627" end="48.976">不</span><span begin="49.144" end="49.677">想</span><span begin="49.677" end="50.266">逃</span></p