in="1:11.905" end="1:12.423">照顾你</span> <span begin="1:12.423" end="1:12.964">到永远</span> <span begin="1:12.964" end="1:13.611">不论任何</span><span begin="1:13.611" end="1:14.112">关头</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.339" end="1:46.550" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1000"><p begin="1:14.339" end="1:16.760" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:14.339" end="1:14.933">多少爱情</span><span begin="1:14.933" end="1:15.289">都根本</span><span begin="1:15.289" end="1:15.795">抵不过</span><span begin="1:15.795" end="1:16.278">时间的</span><span begin="1:16.278" end="1:16.760">洪流</span></p><p begin="1:16.904" end="1:19.437" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:16.904" end="1:17.255">都多么</span><span begin="1:17.255" end="1:17.606">轰烈</span><span begin="1:17.606" end="1:18.399">却根本只不过</span><span begin="1:18.399" end="1:18.912">曾经的</span><span begin="1:18.912" end="1:19.437">拥有</span></p><p begin="1:19.451" end="1:22.025" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.451" end="1:19.921">对你我却</span><span begin="1:19.921" end="1:20.635">那么坚定</span> <span begin="1:20.715" end="1:21.241">为你奋不</span><span begin="1:21.241" end="1:22.025">顾身前进</span></p><p begin="1:22.035" end="1:26.199" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:22.035" end="1:24.677">我</span> <span begin="1:24.677" end="1:25.006">我</span><span begin="1:25.293" end="1:25.758">想</span><span begin="1:25.861" end="1:26.199">要</span></p><p begin="1:26.209" end="1:27.190" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.209" end="1:26.671">追随你</span> <span begin="1:26.671" end="1:27.190">为了你</span></p><p begin="1:27.200" end="1:29.496" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.200" end="1:27.616">我愿意</span><span begin="1:27.616" end="1:28.099">放弃我</span><span begin="1:28.099" end="1:28.581">所有的</span><span begin="1:28.581" end="1:29.496">骄傲与浮躁</span></p><p begin="1:29.534" end="1:32.494" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:29.534" end="1:30.035">只为让</span> <span begin="1:30.035" e